Chinese: “If you attack us, we will fight back.”
British: “You will lose.”
Chinese: “We will fight to the death.”

Day 2
Warm-up (5 min): Have students imagine they are an animal in the zoo. They must move around the classroom and make the sounds of the animal.

Introduction (5 min): Teacher will go over the drama exercise from yesterday and discuss the conflicts between China and Britain.

