5. "O.J.: Made in America" (2016) - Directed by Ezra Edelman, this film is a comprehensive look at the life and career of O.J. Simpson, as well as the social and political context of the murder trial that captivated the nation in the 1990s. The film won the Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.

